        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "(Et4N)(dcnm) (100 mg, 446 μmol) in methanol (1 mL) was added to 1,10-phenanthroline monohydrate (44 mg, 222 μmol) in methanol (4 mL). CeCl3·7H2O (41 mg, 110 μmol) in methanol (1 mL) was then added, and the solution was allowed to evaporate to dryness over 1 month. A small orange crystal of β-1Ce was removed from an amorphous white precipitate. Carbonate formed by atmospheric CO2 fixation and ccnm by in situ hydration of dcnm. Insufficient material for further analysis of solvation.",
